<!--Post: 5590--><!--Time: 1107211033-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5590"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 2:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Another map update including the location of the purse <BR><a href="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/Wichita9a.jpg" target=_top>http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/Wichi ta9a.jpg</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5590-->
<!--Post: 5635--><!--Time: 1107228613-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5635"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Gramsleuth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Gramsleuth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 7:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ANALYZER, THANKS FOR THE MAPS. They make everything so much clearer. <BR> <BR>WPD has a big problem.  The map practically screams out where the BTK lives.  And yet the police can&#39;t find him.  They are incompetent.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5635-->
<!--Post: 5642--><!--Time: 1107230121-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5642"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 7:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->People really should think about what they are implying before they post. <BR>This person is saying they can locate and identify BTK by looking at one map. <BR> <BR>O.K. Please share your insight, where does he live? <BR> <BR>IQ<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5642-->
<!--Post: 6210--><!--Time: 1107580474-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6210"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Newyorker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Newyorker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 9:14 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is most definitley a BTK crime except for one little aspect, he left her for the public to find. That&#39;s not in his usual pattern.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6210-->
<!--Post: 6514--><!--Time: 1107845244-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6514"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sgtrandolph<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sgtrandolph<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 10:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe he was a little out of practice? <BR> <BR>It does sound like him.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6514-->
<!--Post: 6546--><!--Time: 1107883995-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6546"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 08, 2005 - 9:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->For those of us who grew up in Park City and new the Hedge family,and still have family that remains in the same neighborhood, the posting of her address has outraged us all. That type of irresponsible posting, lack of consideration and respect should be banned from this board. As for the pine needles, the Hedges had pine trees in their front yard for years! LV&amp;T we have never forgotten. We still miss Marine. When this sick monster is caught, we hope it brings all these years of wondering and waiting for you some peace.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6546-->
<!--Post: 6806--><!--Time: 1108016003-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6806"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sgtrandolph<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sgtrandolph<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 10:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There was a theory somewhere that some life-altering event may have been what caused him to drop off of the radar in 1979 - possibly because he couldn&#39;t survey his victims or plan out his attacks anymore without arousing suspicion &#40;can&#39;t spell today&#41;.  Maybe that had something to do with the change in this attack - leaving the body out in the open.  Who knows?  Maybe I&#39;m just reaching here ... <BR> <BR>Rocky, my apologizes for the insult.  I&#39;m sure that others will think twice before posting such personal information in the future.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6806-->
<!--Post: 6951--><!--Time: 1108089935-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6951"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 6:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->sgtrandolph:  <BR>Thank you for your consideration<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0>Our families were close and it still hurts a lot when I think of Marine and what the sick monster has done to her. Marine was a wonderful lady. I remember when she got her Monte Carlo, the first person she wanted to show it to was my Mom. She was so proud of that car, and I remember that she looked very classy driving it. I too want to find out who is responsible for Marine&#39;s death. I believe that BTK is responsible, as does her family. I know that in the first few days that Marine was missing, my mother became physically ill to a point of nervous breakdown, and once it was disclosed that her body had been found our family was devastated. So please remind everyone that posts&#39; on any victim or possible victim board, that there is most likely someone reading that information that does know these victims personally. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6951-->
<!--Post: 6979--><!--Time: 1108105872-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6979"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:williammichael@direcway.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Oklahoma_mike<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Oklahoma_mike<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 11:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky, Thanks for your post directly above.  It is so easy to forget in the everyday and think of the victims abstractly.  I suppose we use it as a kind of defense.  But you are absoloutely right about thinking of victims families and friends when we post.  I try to remember &#40;but sometimes forget--my apologies&#41; to call all the victims by formal names, Mrs. Otero, Miss Fox or Mrs. Hedge.  We owe them all that little measure of respect any time we can offer it.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6979-->
<!--Post: 7460--><!--Time: 1108505904-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7460"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 15, 2005 - 2:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I can&#39;t take credit for this as I built it based upon a posting by Christen Iman on another site of interest.  <BR>I found that analysis highly interesting. <BR> <BR><a href="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/Wichita18.jpg" target=_top>http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/Wichi ta18.jpg</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
