<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8979"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 5:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes, the sick bastard lives around the corner from my family and Marine. My family is telling me that they have found jewlery that belongs to Marine and Mrs. Davis.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
