<!--Post: 8983--><!--Time: 1109381334-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8983"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 5:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->As highly suspected, Hedge and Davis sound like his work<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8983-->
<!--Post: 8989--><!--Time: 1109381719-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8989"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 5:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think I&#39;m going to be sick. You know I wouldn&#39;t disclose a lot of things on this board out of fear that my family would be swabbed, robbed or whatever, but now I&#39;m really freaked out knowing this guy lived by my family and was binding, torturing and killing people! What a trip!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8989-->
<!--Post: 8992--><!--Time: 1109381909-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8992"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 5:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky, this feeling of sickness has just started for you, your family, and community.  I and many other have your community and every victim in our prayers ...  we wish you well <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/sad.gif" ALT=":-&#40;" BORDER=0> <BR> <BR>Its happening ... its really happening<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8992-->
<!--Post: 8995--><!--Time: 1109382362-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8995"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 5:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->As I sit her and contemplate going back home this weekend to spare my poor Dad of the media circus that will take place, I can&#39;t help but think of Marine&#39;s bestfriend, my mother, and wondering since her passing if she didn&#39;t hookup with Marine for some divine intervention. To Marine&#39;s family I hope to see you when I come back there!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8995-->
<!--Post: 9056--><!--Time: 1109388803-->
